# Generated by `pnpm plan:board`. Each item is one line of up to ~10 000
# characters, and prettier does not converge on lines that long: it eats the
# space between an inline code span and the word beside it, and once it has, it
# rewrites CRON_SECRET as CRON*SECRET. The generator writes the line back as
# the tracks have it, so write and check would disagree forever. The old
# workaround was to delete those spaces in the tracks themselves, and that is
# how 07-launch.md lost two variable names — with them the only clue that its
# own note contradicted itself, since a grep for the real name found nothing
# (repaired 2026-11-19 by naming the variables without a `_*` suffix, which is
# the part prettier mangles). This file is generated; prettier has no business
# in it.
docs/plan/PENDIENTES.md
